00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.270
And I think the best
part about the book is

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:03.681
there's a huge cocktails chapter.

00:02:03.681 --> 00:02:05.640
And I highly encourage people
- Awesome.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.120
to make a cocktail first,

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.770
so that they can drink
while making the meal.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.600
- Yeah, that's the only
time you'll find me cooking

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.290
