that you're so beautiful

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.740
and you have adventurous
eaters as children.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.050
That's, like, it's ruined my day.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:12.690
- Oh my God, my boy
doesn't eat really at all.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:15.330
But my girl, well, she's
like, I'll eat anything.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.140
As long as there's some
kind of treat coming.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.820
She's like, I will eat
anything in the world.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.130
Yeah, she's kind of like that.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.883
So what, you also launched
a magazine, "Sweet July".

00:03:24.883 --> 00:03:25.716
So what.
- Good job.

00:03:25.716 --> 00:03:26.610
