00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.130
Like who launches magazines?

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:30.040
It's like, what was your
inspiration for that?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:30.873
- I don't know.

00:03:30.873 --> 00:03:32.940
I'm still trying to
figure out like how they,

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.960
they chose me to do this.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.560
But I'm so thrilled about it.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.320
I, you know, it's called "Sweet July"

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.070
