happiest times in our life.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.080
And one of the most exciting,

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.270
and I was like why can't we implement

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.720
the way that we feel today

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.290
into our everyday life?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.123
So the magazine's
- Oh.

00:03:51.123 --> 00:03:53.620
really a mantra to just,
you know, keep it positive,

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.990
