00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.800
So it's celebrating the small moments

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.440
along with the big things.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.630
And so that's how "Sweet July" came about.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:08.570
And it's just this reflection
